{"id":3095,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><div><p>中北大学2026年校级“十佳心灵守护天使”评选结果揭晓，计算机科学与技术学院25070542班心理联络员黄嘉心凭借扎实的工作实绩与温暖的朋辈陪伴成功入选，为学院心理健康工作再添荣光。</p><p>此前，在学院“心灵使者”评选中，黄嘉心以“别怕，我在”为主题进行答辩，获评学院年度“心灵使者”并推荐参评校级。</p><p>作为班级心理联络员，黄嘉心坚持每周收集宿舍长汇报表，及时反馈同学情绪状态；自主设计心理问卷，主动倾听疏导有困扰的同学。她创新开展拼豆减压、心理电影赏析、冬日漫步等趣味活动，带领班级在手语操比赛中荣获一等奖，用行动传递温暖、凝聚力量，以真诚与善意成为大家信赖的“暖心树洞”。</p><p>此次荣誉既是对黄嘉心个人工作的肯定，也是学院心理育人成效的体现。学院将持续加强心理联络员队伍建设，夯实心理育人根基，营造积极健康的校园氛围。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PolVY2Mz94MNVRL4m7bozWVoR-bUzG8PMR9ZMz98M8V7oll0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyYL1yZMYhVMRv4U8C4UlCsLz6VLNrkU4V7U4CYozNPMNWFLzN8nm6RozMFMNU8UzCJqjfTQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLzG8g47YLRU4gtA8pUicc&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12043&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/12287E473CF3AF717E2EBC1DC629916B/194F7C93/6D4A6\" vheight=\"226.8000030517578\" vwidth=\"340.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PolVY2Mz94MNVRL4m7bozWVoR-bUzG8PMR9ZMz98M8V7oll0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyYL1yZMYhVMRv4U8C4UlCsLz6VLNrkU4V7U4CYozNPMNWFLzN8nm6RozMFMNU8UzCJqjfTQ4Oeo4xmvsU0qIbtpYyPLzG8g47YLRU4gtA8pUicc&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12043&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PU4VYVL4lbLmV7L44r7UzV7MRG4L8V8kMmnkozn2LlrkoRN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysMSy4MYyZUmviUNCaMzffozLiMmQfLm7DMlCYoRNsozQFMRr7MzQfM7WFU878oSb/v2rjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-aMRLJqdinx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12043&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C75378B75BF050A93566A2165F289796/45D56A4B/CA49\" vheight=\"254.8000030517578\" vwidth=\"340.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PU4VYVL4lbLmV7L44r7UzV7MRG4L8V8kMmnkozn2LlrkoRN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysMSy4MYyZUmviUNCaMzffozLiMmQfLm7DMlCYoRNsozQFMRr7MzQfM7WFU878oSb/v2rjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz-aMRLJqdinx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=12043&e=.jpeg\"></p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=PolVY2Mz94MNVRL4m7bozWVoR-bUzG8PMR9ZMz98M8V7oll0gih